## exp022: f0-Conditioned AmpPredictor — ❌ Negative Result

| Metric | exp022 (f0-conditioned) | exp018/019 (baseline AmpPredictor) | Change |
|--------|------------------------|-------------------------------------|--------|
| f0 RPA (mean) | 95.51% | 95.59% (exp019) | -0.08% |
| **Amp Corr** | **0.578** | **0.665** | **-13.1% ↓** |
| **Amp RMSE(log)** | **0.987** | **0.697** | **+41.6% ↓** |
