**Root cause: Classic exposure bias.** The f0-conditioned AmpPredictor was trained with ground truth f0 but tested with diffusion-generated f0. Despite achieving a lower training loss (0.386 vs 0.508), the train-test mismatch caused severe degradation at inference time. The model learned to rely on fine-grained f0 details (vibrato, micro-pitch variations) that diffusion can't perfectly reproduce.

**"当前最佳" remains exp019** (mixed checkpoint with unconditioned AmpPredictor). No update needed.
